{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t國家統計局新聞發言人、副局長毛盛勇表示，首3季度國內生產總值總量超過107萬億元人民幣，按年增速4.6%，符合全年經濟預期增長目標。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n他指出，首3季度經濟增量達到5.7萬億元，增量規模是過去5年來最大。第3季月度指標中，9月份多數指標較7、8月都有改善。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：張詩民\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T03:38:52.742970+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T03:15:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T05:57:53.658342+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T03:37:35.200039+00:00","content_hash":"e4d81d15d4f68f74533b762fad6beec43f6aa7fd3b630bdbc1866e43a54a3206","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}